I am now in the vegetable section.
I am looking for tomatoes and apples.
I see nice, red tomatoes.
I put the tomatoes into the basket.
I also take fresh apples.
Then I see an unfamiliar vegetable.
It is pale green and knobbly.
I do not know this vegetable.
There is a small sign.
The sign says the name: Kohlrabi.
The kohlrabi is not on my list.
How does that taste?
I have no idea.
But I like new food.
I want to try the kohlrabi.
Why not?
I take a kohlrabi.
I put the kohlrabi into the basket too.
